* 3 (Post Beta 48.0, Current)
Effects:
* Give a monster ATK equal to its missing HP. (Post Alpha 3.0)

* Return an ally monster to your deck with +4/+4. (Post Beta 4.1)
* Return an ally monster to your deck with +4/+4. Draw a card. (Post Beta 6.2)
* Return an ally monster to your deck with +4/+4. (Post Beta 10.2)
* Topdeck a random Lost Soul with +2/+2 and Haste. (Beta 48.0)
* Topdeck the next Lost Soul with +2/+2 and Haste. (Post Beta 48.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)
